Description: Provides a transparent, end-to-end workflow for analyzing Odin
  Biolog metabolic phenotyping data in mammalian cell cultures. It begins with 
  automated reading and noise correction (OD₅₉₀ – OD₇₄₀), followed by comprehensive 
  quality control via visual diagnostics—detecting missing wells, inconsistent 
  replicates, anomalous curve shapes and intra- and interplate variance. Area under
  Curve (AUC) is computed summarize metabolic activity. Biological annotations 
  (custom or in-built for PM-M01,PM-M02, PM-M11 - PM-M14) enable group-level 
  comparisons of AUCs.
